 "notes": [
  "Credited to the DeckTech handle 'Jodo Kast17' as on his existing player page (the byline name 'Jodo Kast' is the Dark card's title).",
  "Total 60 as published. The post says 'I start HFTMF to pull staging areas, insurrection and Do or Do Not': starting interrupt Heading For The Medical Frigate; several Effects start, so no single starting Effect is set. Insurrection is not in the list (the change notes say the insurrection strategy was dropped) and is not added.",
  "Posted 'Cmdr Wedge' dested Commander Wedge Antilles (the post says it is the only Wedge he has); 'EPP Luke' dested Luke With Lightsaber; 'R2-D2' dested R2-D2 (Artoo-Detoo); 'Chandrilla' Chandrila; 'Heavy Turbolaser Batteries' Heavy Turbolaser Battery; 'X-Wing Laser Cannons' X-wing Laser Cannon.",
  "'Do, Or Do Not' is the Dagobah Effect (not the Reflections III shield). This is version 2 of his post 9193 ('The Base That Can t Be Found')."
